[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フロッケ号よりはバーバラ号のほうが被害が少ない。\n出すとしたらこっちだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Barbara's in better shape than the Flocke. If we're setting sail, it'll have to be her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "残った武器をバーバラ号に運びましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's move our remaining weapons to the Barbara!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "最悪、討伐はできなくても構いません。\n今回は、定期船の救出だけを考えましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We don't need to defeat it for now. Let's focus on protecting those passenger ships!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシも一緒に行かせて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let me come with you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ！\u3000でも、いいの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina?! Are you sure about this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。居ても立ってもいられないよ、こんなの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I can't just sit around and do nothing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃ、一緒に行きましょ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then let's do it together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし、本当にあれはクヴァレルガなのか……？\n未だに自分の目が信じられねえ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How can that really be Kvarelga...? I still can't believe my eyes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれはクヴァレルガの死骸に、犠牲者の怨念が\n取りついたもの……言うなれば頂獣の亡霊だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's the remains of Kvarelga. It's possessed by the vengeful spirits of its victims. You might call the spirit of an Apexi."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イェルカ！？\u3000どうしてここに！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka!? What are you doing here?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはこっちが言いたいよ。\nまさか、船であの頂獣を追おうってんじゃないだろうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I should be asking you that. Don't tell me you're planning to go after that Apexi with a ship."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そうだけど？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-well, that is the plan..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あちゃー。やっぱりそうか。止めに来て正解だった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh dear. It's just as I thought. It's a good thing I came to stop you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なっ！\u3000止めるってどういうこと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What? What do you mean by that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大陸のご一行様もだ。もし、定期船を助けるために\n海に出ようとしているってんなら、やめな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that goes for our friends from the continent too. If you're planning to set sail to save those passenger ships, forget it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "てめえが何者かは知らねえが……\n邪魔される筋合いはねえな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't know who you are, but you ain't got no right to get in our way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イェルカさん。\nどうして、そんなことを言うんですか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka, what are you saying?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれと戦うのは危険すぎるからだ。\n考えてもみなよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because fighting whatever that is is far too dangerous. Give it some thought."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前さんたちは大陸からの使者。\nこの国にとっては重要な客人だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plus you're envoys from the continent. That means you're our nation's esteemed guests."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーもそうだ。己の天命に背いて危険を\n冒すなんて、黙って見過ごすわけにはいかないね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvie, you too. I can't stand by and watch you defy your divine calling and put yourself in danger."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、もしあいつが進路を変えてこの島に向かって\n来るようなら、その時はアタシが相手してやるさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If that thing changes course and heads for the island, I'll deal with it myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イェルカ……なんかアンタ、様子が……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka... something about you seems..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも……あの頂獣は船を襲おうとしています。\nこのままでは、乗客の方々に危険が！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But... that Apexi will attack those ships. The passengers are in danger!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだな。乗客は確かに危ない。だけど、\nそこに、お前さんたちが命をかける理由があるか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "True, the passengers are in danger. But is that reason enough for you to risk your lives?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんなの命が助かることを願ってはいるよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't get me wrong—I do hope that everyone makes it out alright."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただ、もし襲われて散るなら……\n残念だけど、それが運命だったってことさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if they're attacked and perish... well, that's just fate at work."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（確かに……それはアタシの天命とは関係ない。\n\u3000アタシがやるべきことじゃないかもしれない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(It's true that this has nothing to do with my divine calling. It this something I should involve myself in?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でも……どうにかしないといけないんじゃないの！？\n\u3000教えって、誰かの命より大事なものなの！？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But... shouldn't something be done!? Are our teachings really more important than those lives!?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その言い分を聞き入れるわけにはいきません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't accept that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は錬金術士です。\n錬金術は、みんなを幸せにするための力……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm an alchemist. Alchemy is a power meant to bring happiness to everyone..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "誰かを救うことは、錬金術士としての使命なんです。\nここで退くわけにはいきません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saving people is my duty as an alchemist. I can't turn my back here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（錬金術士としての使命……か。レスナはすごいな。\n\u3000自分のやりたいことがはっきりしてて）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Duty as an alchemist...? Wow, Resna's amazing. She knows her calling.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（じゃあ、アタシは……？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(As for me...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシは……言う通りにするよ。\nうん、危ないもんね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll... do as you say. You're right, it's too dangerous."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょ、あんた……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, what are you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめん。レスナ、ヴァレリア。\nアタシやっぱり島に残るよ。じゃ、頑張って！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry, Resna, Valeria. I'm staying on the island after all. Good luck out there!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだ。それでいい、体の張りどころを間違えるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. It's wise to know when to pick your battles."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "で、お前さんたちはどうする？\u3000嫌な予感がするんだが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What about the rest of you? Going out there can't end well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こっちの意思は変わらないっての！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our minds are made up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうかい。ならば、力ずくで\n言うことを聞いてもらうしかなさそうだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that so? Then I guess I'll have to make you listen the hard way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（運命という言葉選び、私たちを大きな危険から\n\u3000遠ざけようとする行為、この人は恐らく……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The way she talks about fate, trying to keep us away from danger... perhaps...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも今は考えたり話し合ったりしている場合じゃない！\nどいてもらいます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We don't have time to argue about this! Please step aside!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははっいい戦いだ！\nこういうの好きだろ、ヴァレリア！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha ha! It's a fight you want? This is your kind of thing, isn't it, Valeria?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こちらも、本気で行かせてもらいます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We won't hold back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははっ、楽しいねえ！\nなあ、ヴァレリア！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isn't this fun, Valeria?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ……なんかやりづらい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... something's not right!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつ、しぶといわね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's tough..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このままじゃ、船が……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If this keeps up, those ships will...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]